{"id": "4c8fe8af-61e7-4668-b763-925fd0b3c826", "slug": "quantum-core-diagnostics-2", "title": "Quantum Core Diagnostics", "description": "Quantum Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Quantum Core Diagnostics\"\ndescription: \"Quantum Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF4B12\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#DC3600\"\n  background: \"#E3E5E8\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#AEB4BB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"40px\"\n  control: \"39px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Quantum Core Diagnostics\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sakura DesignCode (@sakura-designcode). Views: 1; favorites: 0; remixes: 0.\nTags: card, animated, bento, action, effect.\n## Overview\nQuantum Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nFriday 24 14:32 55 18°C Q_CORE // SYNC_PROTO Operation Logs 14:32:40 SYSTEM BOOT 14:32:41 CORE ALIGNMENT 14:32:42 AWAITING SIGNAL Core Synchronization PRT 09 BOOT VERIFY RDY PRC\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF4B12, secondary #000000, accent #DC3600, background #E3E5E8, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse JetBrains Mono for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Quantum Core Diagnostics</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#e3e5e8] text-gray-800 h-screen flex justify-center items-center overflow-hidden text-sm select-none\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n\n    <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper (Skeuomorphic Light + Beautiful lg Shadow) -->\n    <div class=\"relative w-[95vw] lg:w-[90vw] max-w-[1200px] h-[95vh] lg:h-[85vh] max-h-[800px] rounded-[40px] p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#aeb4bb] shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] anim-element opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-1000 ease-out\">\n\n        <!-- Main HUD Container -->\n        <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f6f8fa] to-[#e4e7ec] rounded-[39px] p-6 lg:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[3fr_1fr] grid-rows-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto_auto] lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-6 overflow-y-auto lg:overflow-hidden\">\n\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <header class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 flex justify-between items-start anim-element opacity-0 translate-y-2 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 delay-100\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                    <div class=\"text-lg font-extralight tracking-wider anim-text text-gray-500\">Friday 24</div>\n                    <div class=\"text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-thin leading-[0.9] tracking-tight flex items-start text-gray-800\" id=\"timeDisplay\">\n                        14:32<span class=\"text-xl lg:text-2xl ml-2 mt-1.5 font-extralight text-gray-500 seconds-display\">55</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"text-right flex flex-col items-end gap-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4 text-gray-500\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"22\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\" width=\"22\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5px;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-2xl font-thin tracking-tight anim-text text-gray-700\">18°C</div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Matrix Panel (Skeuomorphic Inset) -->\n            <main class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 relative rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#c8cdd3] to-white anim-element opacity-0 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 delay-200\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#dce0e5] shadow-[inset_0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08),inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] rounded-[23px] relative flex flex-col justify-center items-center overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden\">\n\n                    <!-- Crosshairs -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-l border-gray-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-3 right-3 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-r border-gray-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-l border-gray-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 right-3 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-r border-gray-400\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-6 left-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 font-medium anim-text\">Q_CORE // SYNC_PROTO</div>\n\n                    <!-- Matrix Grid -->\n                    <div class=\"grid gap-1 mt-8 lg:mt-0\" id=\"matrix\" style=\"grid-template-columns: repeat(32, 8px); grid-template-rows: repeat(7, 8px);\">\n                        <!-- Injected via JS -->\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </main>\n\n            <!-- Log Panel (Beautiful md Shadow) -->\n            <aside class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-start-2 relative rounded-3xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-white/50 to-gray-300 anim-element opacity-0 translate-x-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 delay-300 flex max-h-[200px] lg:max-h-full min-h-0 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#ffffff] to-[#eff1f4] shadow-[inset_0_2px_5px_rgba(255,255,255,1),inset_0_-2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)] rounded-[23px] p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 anim-text font-medium\">Operation Logs</div>\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end gap-2\" id=\"logStream\">\n                        <!-- Initial Logs -->\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-700 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-gray-400\">14:32:40</span><span>SYSTEM BOOT</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-700 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-gray-400\">14:32:41</span><span>CORE ALIGNMENT</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-700 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3\">\n                            <span class=\"text-gray-400\">14:32:42</span><span>AWAITING SIGNAL</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n\n            <!-- Timeline Widget (Beautiful sm Shadow) -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 lg:col-span-2 lg:row-start-3 flex flex-col gap-4 anim-element opacity-0 translate-y-4 blur-sm transition-all duration-700 delay-400\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end px-2\">\n                    <div class=\"text-sm tracking-wide text-gray-600 anim-text font-medium\">Core Synchronization</div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FF4B12] to-[#dc3600] text-white shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)] px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-medium tracking-widest\">PRT 09</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-b from-[#ff6b3b] to-[#dc3600] rounded-3xl px-8 py-6 text-white flex flex-col relative shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm font-medium mb-2 w-full lg:w-[60%]\">\n                        <span class=\"anim-text drop-shadow-sm\">BOOT</span>\n                        <span class=\"mr-0 lg:mr-[20%] anim-text drop-shadow-sm\">VERIFY</span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative h-3.5 flex items-center mb-2\">\n                        <!-- Tick Marks -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 h-1.5 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, #000 0, #000 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 4px);\"></div>\n                        <!-- Solid Bars -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute h-1.5 bg-gray-900 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 rounded-full left-[5%] w-[20%]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute h-1.5 bg-gray-900 shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3),inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 rounded-full left-[40%] w-[30%]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">\n                        <span class=\"ml-[5%] anim-text drop-shadow-sm\">RDY</span>\n                        <span class=\"ml-[25%] anim-text drop-shadow-sm\">PRC</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Animation System\n        const observerOptions = {\n            root: null,\n            rootMargin: '0px',\n            threshold: 0.1\n        };\n\n        const globalObserver = new IntersectionObserver((entries, obs) => {\n            entries.forEach(entry => {\n                if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n                    entry.target.style.opacity = '1';\n                    entry.target.style.filter = 'blur(0)';\n                    entry.target.style.transform = 'translate(0, 0)';\n                    obs.unobserve(entry.target);\n                }\n            });\n        }, observerOptions);\n\n        // Word-by-word splitting and observation\n        document.querySelectorAll('.anim-text').forEach((el, index) => {\n            const text = el.innerText;\n            if(!text) return;\n            const words = text.split(' ');\n            el.innerHTML = '';\n            words.forEach((word, wIdx) => {\n                const span = document.createElement('span');\n                span.innerText = word;\n                if (wIdx < words.length - 1) span.innerHTML += '&nbsp;';\n                span.className = 'inline-block transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-2';\n                span.style.filter = 'blur(4px)';\n                span.style.transitionDelay = `${(index * 50) + (wIdx * 100)}ms`;\n                el.appendChild(span);\n                globalObserver.observe(span);\n            });\n        });\n\n        // Element observation\n        document.querySelectorAll('.anim-element').forEach(el => globalObserver.observe(el));\n\n        // Font Dictionary (A-Z)\n        const font = {\n            'A': ['01110','10001','10001','11111','10001','10001','10001'],\n            'C': ['01110','10001','10000','10000','10000','10001','01110'],\n            'D': ['11110','10001','10001','10001','10001','10001','11110'],\n            'E': ['11111','10000','10000','11110','10000','10000','11111'],\n            'H': ['10001','10001','10001','11111','10001','10001','10001'],\n            'L': ['10000','10000','10000','10000','10000','10000','11111'],\n            'M': ['10001','11011','10101','10001','10001','10001','10001'],\n            'N': ['10001','11001','10101','10011','10001','10001','10001'],\n            'O': ['01110','10001','10001','10001','10001','10001','01110'],\n            'P': ['11110','10001','10001','11110','10000','10000','10000'],\n            'S': ['01111','10000','10000','01110','00001','00001','11110'],\n            'T': ['11111','00100','00100','00100','00100','00100','00100'],\n            'Y': ['10001','10001','10001','01110','00100','00100','00100']\n        };\n\n        const gridCols = 32;\n        const gridRows = 7;\n        const matrixEl = document.getElementById('matrix');\n        const logStream = document.getElementById('logStream');\n        const wordsCycle = [\"SYNC\", \"LOAD\", \"COMP\", \"TEST\", \"HALT\"];\n        let currentWordIndex = 0;\n\n        const dotInactiveClass = 'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#d1d5db] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,1)] transition-colors duration-100 ease-out';\n        const dotActiveClass = 'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FF4B12] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5),0_2px_4px_rgba(255,75,18,0.4)] transition-none';\n\n        const dots = [];\n        for (let r = 0; r < gridRows; r++) {\n            dots[r] = [];\n            for (let c = 0; c < gridCols; c++) {\n                const dot = document.createElement('div');\n                dot.className = dotInactiveClass;\n                matrixEl.appendChild(dot);\n                dots[r][c] = dot;\n            }\n        }\n\n        function mapWordToGrid(word) {\n            const wordWidth = (word.length * 5) + (word.length - 1);\n            const startCol = Math.floor((gridCols - wordWidth) / 2);\n            const map = Array(gridRows).fill(null).map(() => Array(gridCols).fill(0));\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < word.length; i++) {\n                const char = word[i];\n                const charMatrix = font[char];\n                if (!charMatrix) continue;\n\n                const cOffset = startCol + (i * 6);\n                for (let r = 0; r < 7; r++) {\n                    for (let c = 0; c < 5; c++) {\n                        if (charMatrix[r][c] === '1') {\n                            map[r][cOffset + c] = 1;\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            return map;\n        }\n\n        function addLog(message, highlight = false) {\n            const now = new Date();\n            const timeStr = `${String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0')}`;\n\n            const entry = document.createElement('div');\n            entry.className = `text-xs grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-3 opacity-0 translate-x-4 transition-all duration-300 ease-out ${highlight ? 'text-[#FF4B12] font-semibold' : 'text-gray-700 font-medium'}`;\n            entry.innerHTML = `<span class=\"${highlight ? 'text-[#FF4B12]/80' : 'text-gray-400'}\">${timeStr}</span><span>${message}</span>`;\n\n            logStream.appendChild(entry);\n\n            // Trigger animation\n            requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n                entry.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-x-4');\n            });\n\n            if(logStream.children.length > 8) {\n                logStream.removeChild(logStream.firstChild);\n            }\n        }\n\n        async function runCycle() {\n            const word = wordsCycle[currentWordIndex];\n            const targetMap = mapWordToGrid(word);\n\n            addLog(`EXECUTING PROTOCOL: ${word}`, true);\n\n            for (let c = 0; c < gridCols; c++) {\n                for (let r = 0; r < gridRows; r++) {\n                    if (targetMap[r][c] === 1) {\n                        dots[r][c].className = dotActiveClass;\n                    }\n                }\n                await new Promise(res => setTimeout(res, 35));\n            }\n\n            addLog(`PROTOCOL ${word} STABLE. HOLDING.`);\n            await new Promise(res => setTimeout(res, 2500));\n\n            addLog(`PURGING MATRIX...`);\n            for (let r = 0; r < gridRows; r++) {\n                for (let c = 0; c < gridCols; c++) {\n                    dots[r][c].className = dotInactiveClass;\n                }\n            }\n\n            await new Promise(res => setTimeout(res, 1200));\n\n            currentWordIndex = (currentWordIndex + 1) % wordsCycle.length;\n            runCycle();\n        }\n\n        function updateClock() {\n            const now = new Date();\n            const display = document.getElementById('timeDisplay');\n\n            const hhmm = `${String(now.getHours()).padStart(2, '0')}:${String(now.getMinutes()).padStart(2, '0')}`;\n            const ss = String(now.getSeconds()).padStart(2, '0');\n\n            // Rebuilding to preserve spans and styles without re-triggering animations\n            const currentHTML = display.innerHTML;\n            if(!currentHTML.includes(hhmm) || !currentHTML.includes(ss)) {\n               display.innerHTML = `${hhmm}<span class=\"text-xl lg:text-2xl ml-2 mt-1.5 font-extralight text-gray-500\">${ss}</span>`;\n            }\n        }\n\n        setInterval(updateClock, 1000);\n        updateClock();\n        setTimeout(runCycle, 2000);\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "quantum-core-diagnostics-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/quantum-core-diagnostics-2.jpg", "source_name": "quantum-core-diagnostics-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 107, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "f78092cf-e149-48ff-99e9-efabe9a28d39", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:32:28.009385+00:00"}